                                "sense_id": "6278e14c-8396-3f7f-9694-4249654d8bf4",
                                "text": "All the metals unite with iodine, and form compounds which have been called iodes, iodures, or iodides. The last term is to be preferred, on account of the analogy of the compounds denoted by it with oxides and chlorides."
